the equilibrium temperature `T_eq(λ)`); the calendar
ticks in accumulated thermal phase Θ (thermal time
`dΘ/dt = T_eq/T̄`, the β-time of ThermalClock T1: colder
⇒ larger β ⇒ the same thermal tick takes longer), and
thirteen modules divide the year at Θ = k/13.

This pin fixes ONE design instance — the Schoolcraft,
